      "content": "it's not just about the scholarship though. it's the way they look at me. they look at me like i'm the prize, the one who actually made it. if i lose that, i'm just a burden. i feel like i've ruined their whole life's work. how am i supposed to look them in the eye knowing i'm the reason they won't get to see the future they planned for us? i feel like i'm just dragging them down into this mess with me.",
